        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia L.D12012, Smart Lock with Loft Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Smart Lock Loft Handleset was designed with security and style in mind. This is a Smart lock, although you may not be able to tell from the outside. The OMNIA+ Level product line has all the smart front door lock technology hidden inside the door. Since it is powered by a CR2 battery, there is no hardwiring. The Smart Lock with Loft Lever is easy to install on most pre-drilled doors. The Level Bolt App allows you to control your lock from anywhere. Lock, unlock, share access, see who comes and goes, and more using your app from almost anywhere. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-scallop-oiled.jpg?v=1704354528\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" atl=\"Omnia L.D12012 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-door-lever-set-with-square-rose-omnia-12s\">Interior Loft Lever</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Level Bolt App Features:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lock and unlock using your phone.</li>\r\n<li>Auto-Lock and Auto-Unlock.</li>\r\n<li>Show Activity.</li>\r\n<li>App is available for iOS and Android.</li>\r\n<li>Create and manage keyless access.</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Amazon Alexa, Ring, and Apple HomeKit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia L.D12012 Loft Lever Smart Front Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Battery: CR2</li>\r\n<li>Backup Mechanical Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Smart Lock Loft Handleset",
                "description": "The Smart Lock Loft Handleset was designed with security and style in mind. This is a Smart lock, although you may not be able to tell from the outside. The OMNIA+ Level product line has all the smart front door lock technology hidden inside the door. Since it is powered by a CR2 battery, there is no hardwiring. The Smart Lock with Loft Lever is easy to install on most pre-drilled doors. The Level Bolt App allows you to control your lock from anywhere. Lock, unlock, share access, see who comes and goes, and more using your app from almost anywhere. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Omnia L.D12012 Loft Lever Smart Front Door Locks, Smart Lock with Lock Levers, Smart Lock Loft Handlesets, Omnia L.D12012, Level Modern Deadbolt Entrance Lever Locksets, OMN-L.D12012, Omnia+ Deadbolt Locksets with Plates, Modern Deadbolt Entrance Lever Lockset with Plates powered by Level , modern smart locks, app controlled front door locks,"
